 who survived the zapping barrier twice! Man, you threw me into that thing fast! Anyone smell burnt rubber?","de":"Guess who survived the zapping barrier twice! Man, you threw me into that thing fast! Anyone smell burnt rubber?","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/045.mp3"},{"t":258.202,"end":263.002,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"*laughing*","de":"*laughing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/046.mp3"},{"t":278.205,"end":281.441,"chars":[2,5,6,10],"who":"Stella, Nami, Usopp, Chopper","text":"Huh? *scream*","de":"Huh? *scream*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/047.mp3"},{"t":282.254,"end":284.171,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"Ooohhhohoho...","de":"Ooohhhohoho...","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/048.mp3"},{"t":284.044,"end":286.144,"chars":[2],"who":"Stella","text":"*terrified whimper*","de":"*terrified whimper*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/049.mp3"},{"t":286.694,"end":289.344,"chars":[6],"who":"Usopp","text":"Watch where you're stepping! You coulda killed us!","de":"Watch where you're stepping! You coulda killed us!","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/050.mp3"},{"t":289.027,"end":292.077,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"Oops! Sorry! *giggle*","de":"Oops! Sorry! *giggle*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/051.mp3"},{"t":290.653,"end":292.37,"chars":[11],"who":"York","text":"*terrified, quiet squeal*","de":"*terrified, quiet squeal*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/052.mp3"},{"t":293.01,"end":297.493,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"*laughing*","de":"*laughing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/053.mp3"},{"t":294.327,"end":295.394,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"*impressed whistle*","de":"*impressed whistle*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/054.mp3"},{"t":295.469,"end":299.802,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"Look at you! Bonney's not the only one who's hit a growth spurt.","de":"Look at you! Bonney's not the only one who's hit a growth spurt.","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/055.mp3"},{"t":299.689,"end":303.039,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"You won't lay a finger... on Old Man Apple.","de":"You won't lay a finger... on Old Man Apple.","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/056.mp3"},{"t":302.802,"end":309.169,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"Listen, kid, some of us have jobs. Let me go back to doing mine, please.","de":"Listen, kid, some of us have jobs. Let me go back to doing mine, please.","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/057.mp3"},{"t":309.563,"end":313.713,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"Heh. Let you go? Okaaaay!","de":"Heh. Let you go? Okaaaay!","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/058.mp3"},{"t":312.894,"end":314.461,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"*frightened gasp*","de":"*frightened gasp*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/059.mp3"},{"t":314.844,"end":318.011,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"*laughing*","de":"*laughing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/060.mp3"},{"t":318.11,"end":322.293,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"*grunting*","de":"*grunting*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/061.mp3"},{"t":319.427,"end":322.26,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"*fearful screaming*","de":"*fearful screaming*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/062.mp3"},{"t":323.394,"end":326.427,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"Woo! WHEEEEEE!!!!","de":"Woo! WHEEEEEE!!!!","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/063.mp3"},{"t":325.794,"end":328.261,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"whoa-Whoa-WHOa...","de":"whoa-Whoa-WHOa...","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/064.mp3"},{"t":329.301,"end":330.868,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"ahhh... EOh!","de":"ahhh... EOh!","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/065.mp3"},{"t":331.744,"end":336.444,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"GET READYYYYY!!! *laughing*","de":"GET READYYYYY!!! *laughing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/066.mp3"},{"t":335.715,"end":339.865,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"*fearful screaming*","de":"*fearful screaming*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/067.mp3"},{"t":339.495,"end":344.862,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"Ba Ba Ba Ba Ba Ba [a lot]","de":"Ba Ba Ba Ba Ba Ba [a lot]","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/068.mp3"},{"t":340.26,"end":343.01,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"IS THIS REALLY NECESSARY?!","de":"IS THIS REALLY NECESSARY?!","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/069.mp3"},{"t":345.777,"end":348.044,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"*laughing*","de":"*laughing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/070.mp3"},{"t":345.877,"end":347.794,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"Woah! Take it easy!","de":"Woah! Take it easy!","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/071.mp3"},{"t":353.186,"end":355.103,"chars":[10],"who":"Chopper","text":"*impressed sobbing*","de":"*impressed sobbing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/072.mp3"},{"t":353.348,"end":354.898,"chars":[6],"who":"Usopp","text":"*proud, impressed sobbing*","de":"*proud, impressed sobbing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/073.mp3"},{"t":355.983,"end":363.966,"chars":[0],"who":"Luffy","text":"HOOOO! *laughing* LOOK AT HIM FLYING! *laughing*","de":"HOOOO! *laughing* LOOK AT HIM FLYING! *laughing*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/074.mp3"},{"t":362.61,"end":364.11,"chars":[10,6,5],"who":"Chopper, Usopp, Nami","text":"*impressed sounds*","de":"*impressed sounds*","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/075.mp3"},{"t":372.637,"end":374.37,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"Mmm.","de":"Mmm.","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/076.mp3"},{"t":376.085,"end":380.035,"chars":[1],"who":"Kizaru","text":"I might drown... that won't do at all.","de":"I might drown... that won't do at all.","orig":"scenes/one_piece_luffy_vs_kizaru/lines/077.mp3"},{"t":387.36,"end":391.56,"ch